TI  - How Individual and Sound Characteristics Interactively Determine Perceived Soundscape Restorativeness in Coastal Urban Spaces —An Empirical Study in a Typical Sea-fronting Context
ST  - 沿海城市空间使用者与声音特征如何交互决定声景恢复性体验——基于典型滨海环境场景的实证研究
