TI  - Summer-time performance of Finnish housing: POE of five apartments
PY  - 2024
T2  - International Journal of Building Pathology and Adaptation
VL  - 43
IS  - 8
SP  - 1
EP  - 25
DO  - 10.1108/IJBPA-03-2024-0059
