TI  - Effects of Noise from Oil and Gas Development on Raptors and Songbirds—A Science Synthesis to Inform National Environmental Policy Act Analyses
PY  - 2024
T2  - USGS Scientific Investigations Report
VL  - 2024
DO  - 10.3133/sir20245087
