TI  - Vermilion flycatchers avoid singing during sudden peaks of anthropogenic noise
PY  - 2023
T2  - Acta Ethologica
VL  - 26
IS  - 3
SP  - 201
EP  - 210
DO  - 10.1007/s10211-022-00409-x
