TI  - Foraging Strategies Determine the Effect of Traffic Noise on Bats
PY  - 2015
T2  - Acta Chiropterologica
VL  - 17
IS  - 2
SP  - 347
EP  - 357
DO  - 10.3161/15081109ACC2015.17.2.010
